  "body": "> The cookieStore getter steps are to return this's relevant settings object's CookieStore object.\r\n\r\nHowever, there is no definition that environment settings objects have an associated CookieStore object; the link for \"CookieStore\" just goes to the interface definition.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, you probably don't want all environment settings objects to have one. Instead you only want Window and ServiceWorkerGlobalScope objects to have one.\r\n\r\nSo I'd suggest adding definitions in each of those sections like\r\n\r\n> A `Window` has an **associated `CookieStore`**, which is a `CookieStore`.\r\n\r\nand then you can do\r\n\r\n> The cookieStore getter steps are to return this's [associated CookieStore].",
